      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The impact of the degree of anticoagulation in patients who underwent stent implantation without glycoprotein IIb/IIIa inhibitors was examined in 1,020 patients. High levels of procedural anticoagulation with heparin were found to increase hemorrhagic complications without improving clinical or angiographic outcomes."},
